+# Approved artwork
+
+Generated with the built-in OpenAI image-generation tool on 24 October 2026. The user approved the illustration and requested entertainment styling distinct from the professional Wallaby tools.
+
+Brief: a polished Android app icon for Wallaby Popcorn; a charming Australian wallaby with long upright ears, warm tan fur, expressive face and long tail holding a filled striped popcorn bucket; cool cinema mood, midnight plum backdrop, teal and warm gold accents; bold readable mascot composition, no text, watermark or Jellyfin mark. The original approved image is `wallaby-popcorn.png`.
+
+Launcher sizes are derived from the approved artwork; Android adaptive foregrounds use padding to protect the mascot from system masks. The separate monochrome vector supports themed icons and notification tinting.
